  fishName: Lurktoad
  description: "Famously difficult to catch, the lurktoad's prescence can be identified
    by the distinctive groups of holes it leaves in the ice when feeding every 2-3
    months. These are also the only time it is possible to see- and capture- one.\\n\\n 
    Chef's Notes:\\nNyaaaa, never has something been so difficult to find, yet so
    useless in the kitchen! If they weren\u2019t so rare, noone would be interested
    in eating them at all..."
